    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>You have just selected the abdominal preset and found the liver. Which control should you set next?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Depth comes before gain, because changing depth changes what needs amplifying. Setting gain first means setting it twice.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
