  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>Q016</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>In this course&#39;s liver protocol, changing the patient&#39;s position should happen:</p>]]></text></questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>The last step of the protocol is to change position and re-cover any region that was not adequately seen. Skipping it is how the top of the liver goes unimaged.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
