    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Lumen only, longitudinal, at a consistent, defined point along its course, perpendicular to the long axis. Follow your local protocol's measurement convention, and distinguish this standard measurement from documentation of the widest abnormal segment if the duct is irregular.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
